<p>
  The form is a <code>Y.Map</code> named <code>form</code>, keyed by field
  name. Each text field holds a nested <code>Y.Text</code>, so if two people
  type in the same field at once, both keep their edit. Try it with the name
  field in both windows.
</p>
<p>
  The role is a plain value in the map. A choice has no characters to merge,
  so the last pick wins.
</p>
